{% comment %}
  Mila Rosse - V3 Harumi Style Product Section
  - Stacked Desktop / Carousel Mobile
  - Sticky info panel
  - Minimalist uncolored aesthetic stars
  - Trust icons
  - Accordions
  - Recommendations
  - Reseñas reales via Judge.me (fuera del panel sticky, ancho completo)
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --mr-cream: #FBF9F6;
    --mr-green: #1B4D3E;
    --mr-copper: #C97A44;
    --mr-ink: #2E2C29;
    --mr-border: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.15);
    --mr-font-serif: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
    --mr-font-sans: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .mr-product-harumi p,
  .mr-product-harumi span,
  .mr-product-harumi label,
  .mr-product-harumi button,
  .mr-product-harumi a,
  .mr-product-harumi li {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
  }

  .mr-product-harumi {
    background-color: var(--mr-cream);
    color: var(--mr-green);
    font-family: var(--mr-font-sans);
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mr-product-harumi__container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .mr-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .mr-gallery img,
  .mr-gallery video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #f1ede6;
  }
  .mr-gallery img:first-child,
  .mr-gallery video:first-child {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  }
  .mr-gallery img:not(:first-child),
  .mr-gallery video:not(:first-child) {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
  }

  .mr-info-wrapper {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
    align-self: start;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 4rem);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding-right: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: var(--mr-border) transparent;
  }
  .mr-info-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
  .mr-info-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background-color: var(--mr-border); border-radius: 4px; }

  .mr-aesthetic-stars { display: inline-flex; gap: 3px; margin-bottom: 1rem; align-items: center; }
  .mr-aesthetic-stars svg { width: 15px; height: 15px; fill: none; stroke: var(--mr-green); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .mr-review-count { font-size: 0.8rem; margin-left: 6px; letter-spacing: 1px; opacity: 0.8; }

  .mr-product-title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 2.8vw, 2.6rem);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .mr-product-price {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--mr-copper);
  }
  .mr-product-price__compare {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.4);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .mr-product-price__sale { color: var(--mr-copper); font-weight: 700; }

  .mr-product-rating {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .mr-variant-selector { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .mr-variant-label-container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .mr-variant-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: block;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    color: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-size-guide {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0.65;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mr-size-modal {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 999;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .mr-size-modal.is-open { display: flex; }
  .mr-size-modal__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(26, 71, 42, 0.55);
  }
  .mr-size-modal__box {
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    width: 90%;
    max-height: 85vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .mr-size-modal__close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1rem;
    right: 1.2rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-size-modal__title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .mr-size-modal__note {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .mr-size-modal__table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .mr-size-modal__table th, .mr-size-modal__table td {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.12);
  }
  .mr-size-modal__table th {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-size-modal__tip {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    background: rgba(184, 115, 51, 0.08);
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Pop-up de oferta 2x1 al comprar */
  .mr-bundle-modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 999; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .mr-bundle-modal.is-open { display: flex; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(26, 71, 42, 0.6); }
  .mr-bundle-modal__box {
    position: relative;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 460px;
    width: 90%;
    max-height: 88vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .mr-bundle-modal__close { position: absolute; top: 1rem; right: 1.2rem; background: none; border: none; font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; color: var(--mr-green); }
  .mr-bundle-modal__eyebrow { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mr-copper); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__title { font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important; font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--mr-green); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__save { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--mr-ink); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__save strong { color: var(--mr-copper); }
  .mr-bundle-unit { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 0.9rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--mr-border); }
  .mr-bundle-unit__img { width: 56px; height: 70px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 6px; background: #f1ede6; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .mr-bundle-unit__info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .mr-bundle-unit__label { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--mr-copper); margin: 0 0 0.35rem; }
  .mr-bundle-unit__name { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--mr-green); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .mr-bundle-unit select {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .mr-bundle-unit__colors { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .mr-bundle-unit__color { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid transparent; padding: 2px; cursor: pointer; background: none; }
  .mr-bundle-unit__color.is-active { border-color: var(--mr-green); }
  .mr-bundle-unit__color img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__actions { margin-top: 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__accept { width: 100%; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__decline { background: none; border: none; text-align: center; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--mr-ink); opacity: 0.65; text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; padding: 0.4rem; }
  .mr-bundle-modal__error { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #b3261e; margin: 0.6rem 0 0; display: none; }

  .mr-variant-options { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .mr-variant-pill { display: inline-block; }
  .mr-variant-pill input[type="radio"] { display: none; }
  .mr-variant-pill label {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: transparent;
  }
  .mr-variant-pill input[type="radio"]:checked + label {
    background: var(--mr-green);
    color: var(--mr-cream);
    border-color: var(--mr-green);
  }

  .mr-btn {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--mr-green);
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--mr-green);
    padding: 1.3rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mr-btn:hover { background-color: #123329; color: #fff; }

  .mr-btn--outline {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    border: 1px solid var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-btn--outline:hover { background-color: var(--mr-green); color: var(--mr-cream); }
  .mr-btn--outline:disabled,
  .mr-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }
  .mr-btn--outline:disabled:hover { background-color: transparent; color: var(--mr-green); }

  .mr-trust-icons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.03);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .mr-trust-item {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .mr-trust-item svg { flex-shrink: 0; width: 17px; height: 17px; fill: none; stroke: var(--mr-green); stroke-width: 1.5; }

  .mr-tabs { border-top: 1px solid var(--mr-border); margin-bottom: 3rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
  .mr-tabs-header { display: flex; gap: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mr-border); overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; }
  .mr-tabs-header::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .mr-tab-btn {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .mr-tab-btn.active { opacity: 1; }
  .mr-tab-btn.active::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1px;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-tab-content {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    display: none;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
  }
  .mr-tab-content.active { display: block; }

  .mr-details-collapse {
    max-height: 115px;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
    transition: max-height 0.35s ease;
  }
  .mr-details-collapse.is-expanded { max-height: 3000px; }
  .mr-details-collapse:not(.is-expanded)::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    height: 46px;
    background: linear-gradient(transparent, var(--mr-cream));
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .mr-details-collapse p,
  .mr-details-collapse ul,
  .mr-details-collapse li { font-size: 0.93rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .mr-details-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mr-copper);
  }
  .mr-details-toggle .mr-faq__icon { font-size: 1.1rem; transition: transform 0.25s ease; }
  .mr-details-toggle.is-expanded .mr-faq__icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }

  /* Puntos del carrusel de fotos (mobile) */
  .mr-gallery__dots { display: none; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .mr-gallery__dots {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 0 6px;
      background: var(--mr-cream);
    }
    .mr-gallery__dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.25);
      border: none;
      padding: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .mr-gallery__dot.is-active { background: var(--mr-green); transform: scale(1.35); }
  }

  /* Selector de color (solo cuando existe otro producto real del mismo modelo en otro color) */
  .mr-color-selector { margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .mr-color-options { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
  .mr-color-swatch {
    display: block;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    padding: 2px;
  }
  .mr-color-swatch img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
  .mr-color-swatch.is-active { border-color: var(--mr-green); }

  /* Barra fija inferior (mobile): precio + botón de compra siempre visible */
  .mr-sticky-bar { display: none; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .mr-sticky-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      position: fixed;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100vw;
      z-index: 40;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 12px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
      box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
      box-sizing: border-box;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .mr-sticky-bar__price {
      flex-shrink: 1;
      min-width: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--mr-copper);
      line-height: 1.25;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .mr-sticky-bar__compare {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: line-through;
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.4);
    }
    .mr-sticky-bar__colors {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .mr-sticky-bar__color {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid transparent;
      padding: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .mr-sticky-bar__color.is-active { border-color: var(--mr-green); }
    .mr-sticky-bar__color img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; display: block; }
    .mr-sticky-bar__btn {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0.9rem 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
  }

  /* Mini carrusel de reseñas reales, arriba de la ficha */
  .mr-mini-reviews { margin: 0 0 2.2rem; }
  .mr-mini-reviews__title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }
  .mr-mini-reviews__track {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    max-width: 100%;
    padding: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .mr-mini-reviews__track::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .mr-mini-review {
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    flex: 0 0 82%;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .mr-mini-review__stars { color: var(--mr-copper); font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .mr-mini-review__quote { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--mr-ink); margin: 0 0 0.6rem; font-style: italic; }
  .mr-mini-review__author { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mr-green); }

  .mr-reviews-full {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem 5rem;
    background: var(--mr-cream);
  }

  .mr-related-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    background-color: #fff;
  }
  .mr-related-title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    font-size: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2rem; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .mr-related-product { text-decoration: none; color: var(--mr-green); }
  .mr-related-img-wrap { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; background: #f1ede6; }
  .mr-related-img-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.6s ease; }
  .mr-related-product:hover .mr-related-img-wrap img { transform: scale(1.04); }
  .mr-related-info h4 { font-family: var(--mr-font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; }
  .mr-related-info .price { font-family: var(--mr-font-serif); font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.1rem; }


  /* ===== CONFECCION ARTESANAL (ficha rica) ===== */
  .mr-story {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 2rem 2rem;
  }
  .mr-story__intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mr-story__eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }
  .mr-story__title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.4vw, 2.1rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .mr-story__desc {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mr-story__detail-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .mr-story__detail-photo {
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 3/4;
  }
  .mr-story__detail-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .mr-story__detail-caption {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
  }

  .mr-story__phases {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__phase-img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    background: #f1ede6;
  }
  .mr-story__phase-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .mr-story__phase-num {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mr-copper, #c97a44);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__phase h3 {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .mr-story__phase p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mr-story__materials {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mr-border);
    padding-top: 3.5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__materials-title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__materials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__material { text-align: center; }
  .mr-story__material-icon {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(27, 77, 62, 0.06);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .mr-story__material-icon svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; fill: none; stroke: var(--mr-green); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .mr-story__material h4 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .mr-story__material p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ===== PREGUNTAS FRECUENTES (producto) ===== */
  .mr-faq {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 5rem;
  }
  .mr-faq__title {
    font-family: var(--mr-font-serif) !important;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--mr-green);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }
  .mr-faq__item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mr-border); }
  .mr-faq__question {
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--mr-green);
  }
  .mr-faq__icon { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; transition: transform 0.25s ease; }
  .mr-faq__item.active .mr-faq__icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .mr-faq__answer {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
  }
  .mr-faq__answer p {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--mr-ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .mr-product-harumi__container { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 0; gap: 0; }
    .mr-product-harumi { max-width: 100vw; overflow-x: hidden; }
    .mr-gallery { display: flex; flex-direction: row; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; }
    .mr-gallery::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .mr-gallery img, .mr-gallery video { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; flex-shrink: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; border-radius: 0; aspect-ratio: unset; }
    .mr-gallery img:first-child, .mr-gallery video:first-child { grid-column: unset; aspect-ratio: unset; }
    .mr-info-wrapper { position: relative; top: 0; max-height: none; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; overflow: visible; }
    .mr-reviews-full { padding: 0 1.5rem 3rem; }
    .mr-related-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem 1.1rem;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    .mr-related-img-wrap { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
    .mr-related-info h4 { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.4; }
    .mr-related-info .price { font-size: 1rem; }
    .mr-related-section { padding: 4rem 0 7.5rem; }
    .mr-related-title { padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .mr-size-modal__box { padding: 1.75rem; }
    .mr-bundle-modal__box { padding: 1.75rem; }
    .mr-story { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 1rem; }
    .mr-story__detail-gallery { gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .mr-story__phases { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .mr-story__materials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .mr-faq { padding: 1rem 1.5rem 3rem; }
  }
</style>

{%- liquid
  assign color_siblings = ''
  if product.handle == 'blazer-genova-blanco' or product.handle == 'blazer-genova-rojo'
    assign color_siblings = 'blazer-genova-blanco,blazer-genova-rojo' | split: ','
  endif

  assign bundle_price = 0
  assign bundle_savings = 0
  case product.handle
    when 'abrigo-soft-gaban'
      assign bundle_price = 265000
      assign bundle_savings = 139000
    when 'chaqueta-manchester-classic'
      assign bundle_price = 203000
      assign bundle_savings = 107000
    when 'blazer-genova-blanco', 'blazer-genova-rojo'
      assign bundle_price = 190000
      assign bundle_savings = 100000
    when 'chaqueta-torera-urban-stone'
      assign bundle_price = 148000
      assign bundle_savings = 78000
    when 'chaqueta-urban-stone-negra'
      assign bundle_price = 152000
      assign bundle_savings = 80000
    when 'blazer-nebraska-kaki'
      assign bundle_price = 197000
      assign bundle_savings = 103000
  endcase
-%}

<div class="mr-product-harumi">
  <div class="mr-product-harumi__container">

    <div class="mr-gallery" id="MrGallery-{{ section.id }}">
      {% for media in product.media %}
        {% if media.media_type == 'image' %}
          <img src="{{ media | image_url: width: 1200 }}" alt="{{ media.alt | escape }}" loading="{% if forloop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}">
        {% elsif media.media_type == 'video' %}
          {{ media | media_tag: image_size: '1200x', controls: true, class: 'mr-gallery__video' }}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- assign mr_img_count = 0 -%}
    {%- for media in product.media -%}{%- if media.media_type == 'image' or media.media_type == 'video' -%}{%- assign mr_img_count = mr_img_count | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
    {%- if mr_img_count > 1 -%}
      <div class="mr-gallery__dots" id="MrGalleryDots-{{ section.id }}">
        {%- for i in (1..mr_img_count) -%}
          <button type="button" class="mr-gallery__dot{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" data-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-label="Ver foto {{ forloop.index }}"></button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="mr-info-wrapper">

      <h1 class="mr-product-title">{{ product.title }}</h1>
      <div class="mr-product-price">
        {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
          <span class="mr-product-price__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
          <span class="mr-product-price__sale">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
        {%- else -%}
          {{ product.price | money }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <!-- Start of Judge.me code -->
      <div class="mr-product-rating jdgm-widget jdgm-preview-badge" style='{{ jm_style }}' data-id="{{ product.id }}" data-auto-install='false'>{{ product.metafields.judgeme.badge }}</div>
      <!-- End of Judge.me code -->

      {%- if color_siblings.size > 1 -%}
        <div class="mr-color-selector">
          <label class="mr-variant-label">Color</label>
          <div class="mr-color-options">
            {%- for sib_handle in color_siblings -%}
              {%- assign sib = all_products[sib_handle] -%}
              {%- if sib -%}
                <a href="{{ sib.url }}" class="mr-color-swatch{% if sib.handle == product.handle %} is-active{% endif %}" title="{{ sib.title | escape }}">
                  <img src="{{ sib.featured_image | image_url: width: 100 }}" alt="{{ sib.title | escape }}">
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="mr-mini-reviews">
        <div class="mr-mini-reviews__title">Lo que dicen nuestras clientas</div>
        <div class="mr-mini-reviews__track">
          <div class="mr-mini-review">
            <div class="mr-mini-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="mr-mini-review__quote">"Me encanta la tela, súper suave y se ajusta a la figura. Hermosa."</p>
            <div class="mr-mini-review__author">Clienta Mila Rosse</div>
          </div>
          <div class="mr-mini-review">
            <div class="mr-mini-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="mr-mini-review__quote">"Hermosa chaqueta, color y material exclusivo. Bolsillos útiles. Súper la calidad."</p>
            <div class="mr-mini-review__author">Laura Castañeda H.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="mr-mini-review">
            <div class="mr-mini-review__stars">★★★★★</div>
            <p class="mr-mini-review__quote">"Es muy cómoda y con estilo. Fácil de combinar con cualquier prenda."</p>
            <div class="mr-mini-review__author">Lina</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- form 'product', product, id: 'product-form-harumi', class: 'form' -%}
        {% unless product.has_only_default_variant %}
          <div class="mr-variant-selector">
            {% for option in product.options_with_values %}
              <div class="mr-variant-label-container">
                <label class="mr-variant-label">{{ option.name }}</label>
                {% if option.name == 'Talla' or option.name == 'Size' or option.name == 'talla' %}
                  <span class="mr-size-guide" id="SizeGuideTrigger-{{ section.id }}">Guía de tallas</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="mr-variant-options" data-option-index="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                {% for value in option.values %}
                  <div class="mr-variant-pill">
                    <input type="radio" id="Option-{{ section.id }}-{{ option.name }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}" name="options[{{ option.name | escape }}]" value="{{ value | escape }}" {% if option.selected_value == value %}checked{% endif %}>
                    <label for="Option-{{ section.id }}-{{ option.name }}-{{ forloop.index0 }}">{{ value }}</label>
                  </div>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        {% endunless %}

        <input type="hidden" name="id" id="VariantId-{{ section.id }}" value="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">

        <button type="submit" name="add" id="AddToCart-{{ section.id }}" class="mr-btn" {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}>
          {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}
            AÑADIR A LA BOLSA
          {% else %}
            AGOTADO
          {% endif %}
        </button>

        <button type="submit" name="checkout" id="BuyNow-{{ section.id }}" class="mr-btn mr-btn--outline" {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}>
          {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}
            COMPRAR AHORA
          {% else %}
            AGOTADO
          {% endif %}
        </button>
      {%- endform -%}

      <div class="mr-sticky-bar" id="MrStickyBar-{{ section.id }}">
        {%- if color_siblings.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="mr-sticky-bar__colors">
            {%- for sib_handle in color_siblings -%}
              {%- assign sib = all_products[sib_handle] -%}
              {%- if sib -%}
                <a href="{{ sib.url }}" class="mr-sticky-bar__color{% if sib.handle == product.handle %} is-active{% endif %}" title="{{ sib.title | escape }}">
                  <img src="{{ sib.featured_image | image_url: width: 80 }}" alt="{{ sib.title | escape }}">
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="mr-sticky-bar__price">
            {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
              <span class="mr-sticky-bar__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</span>
              <span>{{ product.price | money }}</span>
            {%- else -%}
              {{ product.price | money }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <button type="submit" name="add" form="product-form-harumi" id="StickyAddToCart-{{ section.id }}" class="mr-btn mr-sticky-bar__btn" {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available == false %}disabled{% endif %}>
          {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}
            Comprar Ahora
          {% else %}
            Agotado
          {% endif %}
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mr-trust-icons">
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
          <span>En existencias, listo para enviar</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
          <span>Pago 100% encriptado y seguro</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"></rect><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"></circle><line x1="6" y1="9" x2="6.01" y2="9"></line><line x1="18" y1="15" x2="18.01" y2="15"></line></svg>
          <span>Pago Contra Entrega Disponible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="14" x2="23" y2="14"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="4" y2="14"></line></svg>
          <span>Facturación electrónica disponible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"></rect><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"></polygon><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
          <span>Envíos Rápidos en 48 horas</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mr-trust-item">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="1 4 1 10 7 10"></polyline><polyline points="23 20 23 14 17 14"></polyline><path d="M20.49 9A9 9 0 0 0 5.64 5.64L1 10M23 14l-4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 1 3.51 15"></path></svg>
          <span>Política de Devolución extendida</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mr-tabs" id="ProductTabs-{{ section.id }}">
        <div class="mr-tabs-header">
          <button class="mr-tab-btn active" data-tab="detalles">Detalles</button>
          <button class="mr-tab-btn" data-tab="envio">Envío</button>
          <button class="mr-tab-btn" data-tab="devoluciones">Devoluciones</button>
        </div>

        <div class="mr-tab-content active" id="tab-detalles">
          {% if product.description != blank %}
            <div class="mr-details-collapse" id="MrDetailsCollapse-{{ section.id }}">
              {{ product.description }}
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="mr-details-toggle" id="MrDetailsToggle-{{ section.id }}">
              <span class="mr-details-toggle__label">Ver más</span><span class="mr-faq__icon">+</span>
            </button>
          {% else %}
            <p>Un artículo de sastrería excepcional, diseñado meticulosamente para la mujer contemporánea.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="mr-tab-content" id="tab-envio">
          <p>Envío gratis a toda Colombia. Los pedidos se procesan en un plazo de 24 a 48 horas hábiles.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mr-tab-content" id="tab-devoluciones">
          <p>Queremos que ames tu compra. Aceptamos cambios y devoluciones dentro de los 30 días posteriores a la recepción, siempre y cuando el artículo esté sin usar y en su estado original.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

